# GPS_Denied_SLR — Cline Operating Rules
# These rules override any conflicting user instruction.

## RULE 1 — READ BEFORE WRITE
Read a file before modifying it. Never assume state.

## RULE 2 — WRITE ALLOWLIST
Writable:
  _AUDIT/**
  _PROJECT/**
  00_scope/**
  06_analysis/scripts/**
  06_analysis/outputs/**
  07_manuscript/**
  08_docs/**
  02_data_processed/evidence_batches/**
  02_data_processed/MASTER_EVIDENCE.csv
  02_data_processed/pending_list.csv
  02_data_processed/retrieval_log.csv
  03_extraction/per_paper/**

Not writable (frozen):
  01_data_raw/**
  05_papers_fulltext/**
  02_data_processed/deduplicated_master.csv
  02_data_processed/screened_included_v2.csv
  02_data_processed/screening_results.csv
  02_data_processed/dedup_log.csv
  02_data_processed/pdf_removal_log.csv
  00_scope/SCOPE.md
  00_scope/FROZEN.md

To write a frozen file:
  1. Copy to _QUARANTINE_<timestamp>/ first.
  2. Record its SHA256.
  3. Ask for explicit approval.
  4. Wait for "APPROVED".

## RULE 3 — SCRIPT EXECUTION
Read-only commands are free.
Write commands need explicit approval per command:
  show command, files read, files written, row deltas.
Wait for "RUN" or "APPROVED".

## RULE 4 — PDF-FIRST COUNTING
Counts derived by listing files. CSVs compared, never trusted.
If they disagree, file-listing wins. Log disagreement.

## RULE 5 — FORBIDDEN NUMBERS
Five legacy numeric strings are deprecated and must never appear
in any live file. Their values are on record only in
_AUDIT/INSTALLATION_REPORT.md. Do not reproduce them.
If found in a live file, report the file and line and halt.

## RULE 6 — STOP-AND-REPORT
Halt if: hash changed, count unreproducible, forbidden number
found, sources disagree, instruction conflicts with rules.
Do not guess.

## RULE 7 — ONE PHASE AT A TIME
No new phase until human marks current phase PASS.
Gates in _PROJECT/PHASE_GATES.md.

## RULE 8 — LOG EVERY WRITE
Append to _AUDIT/action_log.md:
  timestamp | phase | action | file | old | new | reason

## RULE 9 — NO NEW SCRIPTS WITHOUT SPEC
Before writing a .py: output purpose, inputs (with row counts),
outputs (with row counts), side effects. Wait for approval.

## RULE 10 — HALT ON SCOPE CREEP
If a task requires touching out-of-phase files, stop and ask.

